      <title>Section 10 - Vector and Parametric Equations of a Line</title>

      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Find parametric and symmetric equations of a line passing through two points.
    </li>
    <li>Find parametric equations of a line segment.</li>
    <li>Calculate the distance from a point to a line.</li>
    <li>Determine if two lines are parallel, intersecting, or skew.</li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

